{"5356930":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Sort The Dumplings","steam_appid":5356930,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sort The Dumplings is a satisfying sorting game about turning complete chaos into perfectly organized shelves.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive pile of dumplings has taken over the store, and every one of them has a home. Dig through the mess, find matching dumplings, and return them to the correct shelves one by one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>190 unique dumplings across 19 themed collections<\/strong>, there is always something new hiding in the pile. Sort everything from food and ocean creatures to space explorers, fantasy characters, prehistoric creatures, weather, jobs, music, and more.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SORT THE CHAOS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search through a huge pile of dumplings and figure out where every one belongs. Pick them up, carry them through the store, and place them into their matching shelf sections.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE YOUR COLLECTIONS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each shelf contains its own themed collection. Fill every section to complete the category and watch your empty store slowly transform into a colorful wall of perfectly organized dumplings.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WATCH THE WORLD CHANGE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing categories doesn't just change the shelves. The world outside the store can transform to match the collection you've finished, creating new scenes to discover as you progress.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR WAY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between multiple ways to sort:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode<\/strong> — Relax and sort the store at your own pace.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Mode<\/strong> — Race against the clock and see how quickly you can finish.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities Mode<\/strong> — Use special abilities and upgrades to tackle the chaos in a completely different way.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND THEM ALL<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dozens of wildly different dumpling designs, hunt for hidden golden dumplings, complete every shelf, and see if you can turn the entire store from an overwhelming mess into dumpling paradise.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to relax, collect every dumpling, or chase a faster completion time, there's always another dumpling waiting to be sorted.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sort The Dumplings is a satisfying sorting game about turning complete chaos into perfectly organized shelves.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive pile of dumplings has taken over the store, and every one of them has a home. Dig through the mess, find matching dumplings, and return them to the correct shelves one by one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>190 unique dumplings across 19 themed collections<\/strong>, there is always something new hiding in the pile. Sort everything from food and ocean creatures to space explorers, fantasy characters, prehistoric creatures, weather, jobs, music, and more.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SORT THE CHAOS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search through a huge pile of dumplings and figure out where every one belongs. Pick them up, carry them through the store, and place them into their matching shelf sections.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE YOUR COLLECTIONS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each shelf contains its own themed collection. Fill every section to complete the category and watch your empty store slowly transform into a colorful wall of perfectly organized dumplings.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WATCH THE WORLD CHANGE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing categories doesn't just change the shelves. The world outside the store can transform to match the collection you've finished, creating new scenes to discover as you progress.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR WAY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between multiple ways to sort:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode<\/strong> — Relax and sort the store at your own pace.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Mode<\/strong> — Race against the clock and see how quickly you can finish.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities Mode<\/strong> — Use special abilities and upgrades to tackle the chaos in a completely different way.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND THEM ALL<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dozens of wildly different dumpling designs, hunt for hidden golden dumplings, complete every shelf, and see if you can turn the entire store from an overwhelming mess into dumpling paradise.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to relax, collect every dumpling, or chase a faster completion time, there's always another dumpling waiting to be sorted.<\/p>","short_description":"Sort a mountain of adorable dumplings into their proper homes in a chaotic, satisfying sorting game. Discover 190 unique dumplings across 19 themed collections, complete shelves, unlock changing environments, and chase faster times across multiple game modes.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5356930\/204aae816a6722933ab1390dc4254200886fe0f7\/header.jpg?t=1793484846","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5356930\/0a8472016e50c34190e7edf7ed63eef55a21dbdd\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793484846","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5356930\/0a8472016e50c34190e7edf7ed63eef55a21dbdd\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793484846","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB \/ AMD RX 580 8GB<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-10400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 \/ AMD RX 5600 XT<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> SSD recommended<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Black Vault Games"],"publishers":["Black Vault Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":599,"final":599,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$5.99"},"packages":[1850508],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Sort The Dumplings","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1850508,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Sort The Dumplings - $5.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":599}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":